Value Required CLOCK_STATUS (\S+)
Value Required CLOCK_STRATUM (\d+)
Value Required REFERENCE_CLOCK_ID (\S+)
Value NOMINAL_FREQUENCY (\S+\s+\S+)
Value ACTUAL_FREQUENCY (\S+\s+\S+)
Value CLOCK_PRECISION (\S+)
Value CLOCK_OFFSET (\S+\s+\S+)
Value ROOT_DELAY (\S+\s+\S+)
Value ROOT_DISPERSION (\S+\s+\S+)
Value PEER_DISPERSION (\S+\s+\S+)
Value REFERENCE_TIME (.*)

Start
  ^\s*[Cc]lock\s+[Ss]tatus:\s*${CLOCK_STATUS}
  ^\s*[Cc]lock\s+[Ss]tratum:\s*${CLOCK_STRATUM}
  ^\s*[Rr]eference\s+[Cc]lock\s+[Ii][Dd]:\s*${REFERENCE_CLOCK_ID}
  ^\s*[Nn]ominal\s+[Ff]requency:\s*${NOMINAL_FREQUENCY}
  ^\s*[Aa]ctual\s+[Ff]requency:\s*${ACTUAL_FREQUENCY}
  ^\s*[Cc]lock\s+[Pp]recision:\s*${CLOCK_PRECISION}
  ^\s*[Cc]lock\s+[Oo]ffset:\s*${CLOCK_OFFSET}
  ^\s*[Rr]oot\s+[Dd]elay:\s*${ROOT_DELAY}
  ^\s*[Rr]oot\s+[Dd]ispersion:\s*${ROOT_DISPERSION}
  ^\s*[Pp]eer\s+[Dd]ispersion:\s*${PEER_DISPERSION}
  ^\s*[Rr]eference\s+[Tt]ime:\s*${REFERENCE_TIME}\s* -> Record
  ^\s*$$
  ^\s*<[A-Za-z0-9_\-\.]+>.*$$
  ^. -> Error
